From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rafalohaki <rafalohaki@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Jan 2026 00:59:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] baguette optimizations from notes.md

- EntityLookup: UUID regeneration for CMI/Fireballs fix
- Entity: cached collision lists + skip zero movement
- Level: zero-allocation getEntitiesOfClassInto API
- Mob: cached item pickup list
- ServerLevel: exploit prevention (minecarts/boats per chunk)
- FileUtil: ObjectArrayList optimization
- ItemEntity: configurable item merging
- PathFinder: cached lists for pathfinding
- Connection: configurable packet limiter
- ServerExplosion: Object2ObjectOpenHashMap
- FriendlyByteBuf: no-chat-reports feature

diff --git a/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/level/entity/EntityLookup.java b/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/level/entity/EntityLookup.java
